"elder_man_deep|Welcome to the Lantern Garden. I\u2019m Gus. I take care of it.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"elder_man_deep|Ten years ago, in 2030, a new germ spread through Varrow. We call it the Quiet Year.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
