"af_nova|This was my phone in 2030.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_nova|Our school closed on a Monday, and I didn\u2019t see my friends in person for five months.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_nova|Every night at eight, my family video-called Grandma Luc\u00eda, who lived alone across town.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
