"af_river|A germ that sneaks in now gets noticed in days, not weeks. That is what an early warning is for.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_heart|The Quiet Year germ was made with help from an unsafe AI, and its recipe was printed at a DNA print shop.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_heart|After that, the world agreed on a rule: every DNA order gets checked before anything is printed.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
